cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, cite it as below with the version you ran. If you
  use singlet.bio data, also cite the original study of every dataset you use
  (its paper and GEO accession) and singlet.bio (the reference below), with the
  date you downloaded the data. Text, BibTeX and RIS: https://singlet.bio/about#cite
type: software
title: "singlet: Python, R and C++ client and engine for singlet.bio"
abstract: "Client packages (Python, R) and the C++ processing engine for singlet.bio, a catalog of public GEO single-cell RNA-seq studies re-processed from raw reads with one pipeline. Data are CC0; code is MIT."
authors:
  - family-names: DeBruine
    given-names: Zachary
    affiliation: "Grand Valley State University"
    email: debruinz@gvsu.edu
version: 1.3.0
date-released: 2026-10-29
license: MIT
url: "https://singlet.bio"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Singlet-Bio/singlet"
keywords:
  - single-cell
  - RNA-seq
  - GEO
  - bioinformatics
  - open data
references:
